msgstr "CAMIN"

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-install.docbook:380
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Before entering the compile sequence you must make sure all libraries and "
"tools are available to the make system. To accomplish this some environment "
"variables need to be properly set. The actual steps to be performed depend "
"on the console shell you use."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-install.docbook:384
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To avoid typing in all the statements that set the necessary environment "
"variables every time you want to compile, you should put them into your "
"<filename>.bashrc</filename> or <filename>.cshrc</filename> file. This way "
"the environment variables will be properly set every time you start the "
"shell."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: kdevelop-install.docbook:389
#, no-c-format
msgid "Setting the Environment for the bash Shell"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-install.docbook:391
#, no-c-format
msgid "If you use the bash shell add the following lines:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: kdevelop-install.docbook:396
#, no-c-format
msgid "<userinput>export KDEDIR=</userinput>(path to your KDE installation)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: kdevelop-install.docbook:397
#, no-c-format
msgid "<userinput>export QTDIR=</userinput>(path to your Qt library)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: userinput
#: kdevelop-install.docbook:398
#, no-c-format
msgid "export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$QTDIR/lib:$KDEDIR/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: userinput
#: kdevelop-install.docbook:399
#, no-c-format
msgid "export LIBRARY_PATH=$QTDIR/lib:$KDEDIR/lib:$LIBRARY_PATH"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: userinput
#: kdevelop-install.docbook:400
#, no-c-format
msgid "export PATH=$QTDIR/bin:$KDEDIR/bin:$PATH"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: kdevelop-install.docbook:407
#, no-c-format
msgid "Setting the Environment for the tcsh Shell"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kdevelop-install.docbook:409
#, no-c-format
msgid "If you use the tcsh shell add the following lines:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: kdevelop-install.docbook:414
#, no-c-format
msgid "<userinput>setenv KDEDIR </userinput>(path to your KDE installation)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: kdevelop-install.docbook:415
#, no-c-format
msgid "<userinput>setenv QTDIR </userinput>(path to your Qt library)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: userinput
#: kdevelop-install.docbook:416
#, no-c-format
msgid "setenv LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$QTDIR/lib:$KDEDIR/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: userinput
#: kdevelop-install.docbook:417
#, no-c-format
msgid "setenv LIBRARY_PATH $QTDIR/lib:$KDEDIR/lib:$LIBRARY_PATH"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: userinput
#: kdevelop-install.docbook:418
#, no-c-format
msgid "setenv PATH $QTDIR/bin:$KDEDIR/bin:$PATH"
msgstr ""

